Cell["\<\
Take the metric in BS coordinates as an expansion from above to define the \
metric\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.961039421795918*^9, 
  3.9610394514656844`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a792b493-64d1-4862-81b1-\
