Cell["\<\
Looks non-asymptotically flat, but once the integration constants are \
restricted to be the BMS gauge transform and assuming the initial generic \
metric perturbation obeys the linearised Einstein field equations, asymptotic \
flatness is satisfied. See tests folder.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.961040933526456*^9, 
  3.961041062911411*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"94b4302f-e341-4437-8ac7-\
5abdd2a1065d"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

